WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.405
This is a Printing Office

00:00:03.133 --> 00:00:05.114
Crossroads of civilization

00:00:05.715 --> 00:00:09.354
Refuge of all the arts
against the ravages of time

00:00:10.125 --> 00:00:13.532
Armoury of fearless truth
against whispering rumour

00:00:14.197 --> 00:00:16.209
Incessant trumpet of trade

00:00:17.458 --> 00:00:20.297
From this place words may fly abroad

00:00:20.818 --> 00:00:22.950
Not to perish on waves of sound

00:00:23.632 --> 00:00:25.582
Not to vary with the writer's hand

00:00:26.231 --> 00:00:27.639
But fixed in time

00:00:28.115 --> 00:00:29.986
Having been verified in proof

00:00:30.771 --> 00:00:33.891
Friend, you stand on sacred ground

00:00:34.774 --> 00:00:37.400
This is a Printing Office
